   "bio": "2026 (Freshman Season)\n\nSeason: Redshirted his initial season on campus.\n\nPrep/Personal\n\nPlayed for Hall of Fame head coach Steve Strayer at Crown Point High School … pitched to a 15-4 record with a 2.08 earned run average over 124.2 innings of high school baseball … collected 169 strikeouts to just 43 walks in his prep career … guided the Bulldogs to a 2025 IHSAA 4A sectional title … 27th-best prospect in Indiana according to Perfect Game in class of 2025 … 2025 All-Duneland Athletic Conference selection … son of Jason and Laura Cotton …father, Jason, played baseball for IU from 1991-95 … has one brother, Connor … intends to major in Informatics.",
