   "bio": "2026 (Freshman Season)\n\nSeason: Redshirted his initial season on campus.\n\nPrep/Personal\n\nPlayed for head coach Casey LaDuke at Floyd Central High School … missed his senior season of high school through injury … threw a complete game no-hitter with 18 strikeouts in his junior year … the number 67 overall prospect in the class of 2025 by Perfect Game … second-ranked prospect and top-ranked pitcher in the state of Indiana … grew up as an IU fan in Southern Indiana … participated in the 2023 16U/17U USA National Team Development program … played travel baseball for Louisville Sting and Canes Midwest National … an All-Tournament selection at the 2024 WWBA 17U National Championships and the 18U Perfect Game Fall World Series … pitched in the 2024 Perfect Game Junior National All-Star game … son of Justin and Elizabeth … has two siblings, Lance and Drake … intends to major in Intelligent Systems Engineering.",
